      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>CONTROLS</b>\r\n\r\nW, A, S, D \u2014 Move\r\nMouse \u2014 Look around\r\nE
    \u2014 Interact / collect / open doors / hide\r\nCtrl / C \u2014 Crouch\r\nShift
    \u2014 Sprint\r\nLeft Mouse Button \u2014 Use / throw item\r\nEsc \u2014 Pause\r\nTab
    \u2014 Open / close inventory\r\n\r\n<b>STAY ALERT</b>\r\nRunning and throwing
    objects make noise\r\nthat can attract the monster.\r\nUse distractions carefully."
